        "note": "Supplies the statement butson_prime_divisibility (research solved, unproved there) and the definition IsButsonHadamard. Challenge.lean and ButsonHadamard/Defs.lean copy them verbatim, without the category and AMS attributes, which Formal Conjectures defines; scripts/check-fc-match.py checks this against Formal Conjectures at that commit and pins the file by SHA-256. The theorem keeps Formal Conjectures' name.",
